+Initial direct check_generation result
+======================================
+Command:
+PYTHONPATH=/reference python3 -c 'import json; from pathlib import Path; from tools.klean_preflight import check_generation; result=check_generation(Path("/reference/k-proof"),Path("/reference/lemma-discovery.json"),Path("/reference/klean-generation"),toolchain_lock=Path("/reference/klean-toolchain.lock.json")); print(json.dumps(result,indent=2,sort_keys=True))'
+
+Exit: 1
+Output:
+Traceback (most recent call last):
+  File "<string>", line 1, in <module>
+  File "/reference/tools/klean_preflight.py", line 582, in check_generation
+    raise KleanPreflightError(
+tools.klean_preflight.KleanPreflightError: lake clean failed (1): error: could not detect the configuration of the Lake installation
+
+Sandbox PID-namespace diagnosis
+===============================
+Command:
+shell_pid=$$; echo "$shell_pid"; readlink "/proc/$shell_pid/exe"; python3 -c 'import os; print(os.getpid(), os.readlink(f"/proc/{os.getpid()}/exe"))'
+
+Exit: 1
+Output:
+2
+Traceback (most recent call last):
+  File "<string>", line 1, in <module>
+FileNotFoundError: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: '/proc/2/exe'
+
+Lean/Lake with narrow /proc shim
+===============================
+Command:
+LD_PRELOAD=/tmp/audit-work/lean-proc-self-shim.so /opt/elan/toolchains/leanprover--lean4---v4.22.0/bin/lean --version
+
+Exit: 0
+Output:
+Lean (version 4.22.0, x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, commit ba2cbbf09d4978f416e0ebd1fceeebc2c4138c05, Release)
+
+Command:
+LD_PRELOAD=/tmp/audit-work/lean-proc-self-shim.so LEAN_SYSROOT=/opt/elan/toolchains/leanprover--lean4---v4.22.0 LAKE_HOME=/opt/elan/toolchains/leanprover--lean4---v4.22.0/src/lean/lake /opt/elan/toolchains/leanprover--lean4---v4.22.0/bin/lake --version
+
+Exit: 0
+Output:
+Lake version 5.0.0-src+ba2cbbf (Lean version 4.22.0)
+
+Shim build
+==========
+Command:
+cc -shared -fPIC -O2 -Wall -Wextra -Werror -o /tmp/audit-work/lean-proc-self-shim.so /audit-output/evidence/lean-proc-self-shim.c -ldl
+
+Exit: 0
+Output: (empty)
+
+Command:
+sha256sum /audit-output/evidence/lean-proc-self-shim.c /tmp/audit-work/lean-proc-self-shim.so
+
+Exit: 0
+Output:
+69fca32b7538c4ee5b623f00e0b692423d92b80e168146b563119b6eb06a7605  /audit-output/evidence/lean-proc-self-shim.c
+d00b96e4c084f4ea2dd679d15b30921b0bf98be6295cacf5c86595b5bef9e359  /tmp/audit-work/lean-proc-self-shim.so
+
+The shim interposes readlink only when its path is exactly
+"/proc/<getpid()>/exe", replacing it with "/proc/self/exe". It does not alter
+Lean, Lake, generated sources, or mounted inputs.
